  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Support to Strengthening IBM in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support identifying and addressing the gaps in the implementation of the national reforms approximating the Ukrainian border management system to the standards and best practices of the EU Integrated Border Management (IBM). This is in line with the national Integrated Border Management Strategy of Ukraine up to 2025 (IBM Strategy) adopted on 24 July 2019 by the Cabinet of Ministers of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
